{"speciesId":447,"names":{"fr":"Riolu","es":"Riolu","en":"Riolu","ja":"リオル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The aura that emanates from its body intensifies to alert others if it is afraid or sad."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its body is lithe yet powerful. It can crest three mountains and cross two canyons in one night."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It has the peculiar power of being able to see emotions such as joy and rage in the form of waves."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"They communicate with one another using their auras. They are able to run all through the night."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"They communicate with one another using their auras. They are able to run all through the night."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il a la faculté unique de visualiser les émotions telles que la joie ou la colère sous forme d’ondes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has the peculiar power of being able to see emotions such as joy and rage in the form of waves."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il a la faculté unique de visualiser les émotions telles que la joie ou la colère sous forme d’ondes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It has the peculiar power of being able to see emotions such as joy and rage in the form of waves."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It uses the shapes of auras, which change according to emotion, to communicate with others."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It uses the shapes of auras, which change according to emotion, to communicate with others."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il communique avec ses semblables grâce à des ondes qui sont modulées en fonction de ses émotions."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se comunica con los suyos mediante la emisión de unas ondas que cambian de forma en función de los sentimientos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It uses the shapes of auras, which change according to emotion, to communicate with others."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"感情で 形が 変わる 波動を だしあって 仲間同士 コミュニケーションを とっている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son aura s’intensifie pour prévenir son entourage quand il a peur ou qu’il est triste."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su aura se intensifica para alertar a otros cuando está triste o tiene miedo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The aura that emanates from its body intensifies to alert others if it is afraid or sad."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体から 発する 波動は 怖いとき 悲しいときに 強まり ピンチを 仲間に 伝える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il communique avec ses semblables grâce à des ondes qui sont modulées en fonction de ses émotions."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se comunica con los suyos mediante la emisión de unas ondas que cambian de forma en función de los sentimientos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It uses the shapes of auras, which change according to emotion, to communicate with others."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"感情で 形が 変わる 波動を だしあって 仲間同士 コミュニケーションを とっている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Son aura s’intensifie pour prévenir son entourage quand il a peur ou qu’il est triste."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Su aura se intensifica para alertar a otros cuando está triste o tiene miedo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The aura that emanates from its body intensifies to alert others if it is afraid or sad."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体から 発する 波動は 怖いとき 悲しいときに 強まり ピンチを 仲間に 伝える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il perçoit sous forme d’ondes les émotions des humains et des Pokémon, ainsi que tout ce qui l’entoure."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Percibe en forma de ondas las emociones de Pokémon y humanos."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It can discern the physical and emotional states of people, Pokémon, and other natural things from the shape of their aura waves."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"人や ポケモンの 感情や 自然の 様子を 波動 という 波の 形で みているのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Comme il peut passer la nuit entière à courir, il paraît très robuste et persévérant, mais au fond, c’est encore un bébé."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Es un Pokémon valiente y perseverante capaz de pasarse toda una noche corriendo, aunque en el fondo no es más que un bebé."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It’s tough enough to run right through the night, and it’s also a hard worker, but it’s still just a youngster."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"一晩中 走っていられる タフさが あり 頑張り屋 だが まだまだ ひよっ子 なのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il peut détecter les émotions des humains et des Pokémon grâce à leur aura. Il ne s’approche pas des individus qu’il juge dangereux."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Percibe en forma de ondas las emociones de Pokémon y humanos, y jamás se acerca a quien le da la sensación de ser peligroso."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It knows how people and Pokémon feel by looking at their auras. It doesn’t approach dangerous opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"波動と 呼ばれる 波を 見て 人や ポケモンの 気持ちを 知る。 危険な 相手には 近付かない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il se sert d’auras pour communiquer avec les siens. Ses ennemis ne peuvent pas espionner ses conversations, car il n’émet aucun son."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"En lugar de usar la voz, se comunica con los demás mediante ondas conocidas como auras y así pasa desapercibido ante sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It uses waves called auras to communicate with others of its kind. It doesn’t make any noise during this time, so its enemies can’t detect it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"仲間との コミュニケーションに 波動と 呼ばれる 波を 使う。 鳴かないので 敵に ばれないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il possède assez d’endurance pour passer des nuits entières à courir. Il est difficile de partir en balade avec lui tant il déborde d’énergie."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su gran resistencia le permite correr durante toda una noche sin problema, pero tanta energía hace que sea sumamente complicado seguirle el ritmo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It’s exceedingly energetic, with enough stamina to keep running all through the night. Taking it for walks can be a challenging experience."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"一晩中 走っていられる スタミナを もつ。 活発で 散歩の 相手は たいへん。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il perçoit sous forme d’aura non seulement les sentiments des autres, mais aussi l’état de la nature."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Percibe los sentimientos de quienes lo rodean, así como las condiciones del entorno, mediante unas ondas conocidas como auras."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It can use waves called auras to gauge how others are feeling. These same waves can also tell this Pokémon about the state of the environment."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"相手の 感情 だけでなく 自然の 様子も 波動 という 波の 形で 感じとる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Though infantile in appearance, it has the mysterious ability to read the minds of humans. The pure of heart are met with Riolu's approval, while those of ill nature earn only its loathing."}],"varieties":[{"id":447,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"ma